WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 23]

01:43.420 --> 01:45.280
When you approach Xuan Ling Wood,

01:45.930 --> 01:46.789
there should be

01:47.259 --> 01:48.740
a lot of dew on the leaves.

01:54.020 --> 01:54.770
These

01:54.940 --> 01:57.000
are made of Luo Ge's spiritual power.

01:57.860 --> 01:59.380
As long as it touches you,

01:59.780 --> 02:01.840
it can take away your spiritual power

02:02.060 --> 02:03.460
and you don't notice it.

02:04.420 --> 02:05.300
So,

02:06.340 --> 02:07.780
he was trying to test me?

02:10.900 --> 02:11.660
No.

02:12.900 --> 02:15.140
He took evidence like this from you.

02:17.650 --> 02:20.340
So he's pretty sure it's you.

02:22.860 --> 02:23.940
This man

02:24.940 --> 02:26.540
has been guarded against you

02:27.380 --> 02:28.860
the whole time.

02:44.220 --> 02:45.810
Why is the Immortal here again?

02:45.810 --> 02:47.100
Why did he

02:47.100 --> 02:48.780
come to the Demon King this time?

02:48.780 --> 02:50.540
Isn't it enough that he caught General Fu?

02:50.540 --> 02:53.200
The Immortal Palace has been pushing us too far.

02:53.900 --> 02:55.180
Are you here

02:55.500 --> 02:57.370
to return my brother?

03:01.220 --> 03:03.250
You haven't unified the demon world.

03:03.250 --> 03:04.910
How can I return your brother?

03:05.380 --> 03:05.860
Soon.

03:07.020 --> 03:08.260
Please wait and see.

03:08.780 --> 03:09.380
Okay.

03:10.060 --> 03:11.220
But I'm here today

03:12.260 --> 03:13.580
on a different matter.

03:16.980 --> 03:17.820
I need you

03:19.010 --> 03:20.340
to identify something.

03:33.700 --> 03:35.500
The spiritual power that this dew absorbed

03:35.500 --> 03:37.430
has a wisp of Ao Hen's demon energy.

03:38.220 --> 03:39.420
Only her demon energy

03:39.579 --> 03:42.040
can condense into the Spirit Devouring Orb.

03:43.810 --> 03:45.300
Before the scattered demon rebellion,

03:45.300 --> 03:47.820
some people claimed to be the new king to take people's vitality.

03:47.820 --> 03:49.250
I think this is the guy.

03:50.260 --> 03:52.380
Judging from the demon energy's breath,

03:52.380 --> 03:55.340
it must have been swallowed by Ao Hen after her death.

03:57.380 --> 03:58.500
Immortal,

03:58.860 --> 04:00.590
whose spiritual power is this?

04:05.300 --> 04:06.900
I have the answer in my heart.

04:08.220 --> 04:08.940
This time,

04:10.180 --> 04:11.620
I owe you one favor.

04:15.900 --> 04:17.160
You can pay it back now.

04:21.060 --> 04:22.420
If it's General Fu,

04:23.820 --> 04:25.080
I have only one answer.

04:25.620 --> 04:26.140
No.

04:26.300 --> 04:27.380
No?

04:27.820 --> 04:28.980
One day you will.

04:31.820 --> 04:33.740
Now I want someone from you.

04:34.340 --> 04:37.170
I heard that she was wrongly accused many times in the Immortal Palace.

04:37.170 --> 04:38.940
If you're really good to her,

04:39.820 --> 04:41.180
please give her back.

04:42.340 --> 04:43.500
Liu Shao is Liu Shao.

04:44.659 --> 04:46.320
She never belonged to anyone.

04:46.580 --> 04:47.840
How can I give her back?

04:53.420 --> 04:55.280
When she is cleared of suspicion,

04:55.580 --> 04:58.040
she won't be subject to the Immortal Palace.

05:52.700 --> 05:53.560
Junior sister,

05:53.980 --> 05:54.940
we meet again.

05:55.620 --> 05:57.260
This is not the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

05:57.260 --> 05:58.780
Don't talk about the past.

05:59.090 --> 06:01.540
Please follow the rules of the post next time.

06:01.540 --> 06:02.800
Don't trespass again.

06:03.180 --> 06:04.420
When I was practicing,

06:04.420 --> 06:05.300
my sword

06:05.780 --> 06:06.780
didn't have eyes.

06:09.300 --> 06:11.420
The snowflake in the Immortal's room

06:11.580 --> 06:12.820
is from you?

06:13.380 --> 06:14.340
So what?

06:15.290 --> 06:16.860
I like it very much.

06:17.500 --> 06:20.060
I was wondering if Junior Liu Shao could show me

06:20.060 --> 06:21.460
how to do it.

06:22.300 --> 06:22.940
Okay.

06:23.180 --> 06:24.510
I'll tell you right now.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.020
It was you who pretended to be me and killed the Immortal Master Wanwu!

06:49.020 --> 06:49.860
Yes.

06:50.340 --> 06:51.210
So what?

06:51.380 --> 06:53.140
I'd love to know

06:53.730 --> 06:55.380
what makes you think

06:55.620 --> 06:57.220
you can beat me now?

06:58.770 --> 06:59.380
Bai Feng.

07:00.020 --> 07:01.750
I suspected you a long time ago.

07:01.930 --> 07:04.130
Did you really think I wasn't prepared?

07:04.260 --> 07:05.740
Open your eyes.

07:06.820 --> 07:08.140
Is this a snowflake?

07:22.140 --> 07:23.340
How did you

07:23.340 --> 07:24.410
do my master's magic?

07:24.410 --> 07:26.070
I remember what Lu Li taught me

07:26.140 --> 07:27.620
better than anyone.

07:28.300 --> 07:29.500
With your abilities,

07:29.650 --> 07:32.180
you're no match for the Immortal Master Wanwu.

07:32.180 --> 07:32.780
So.

07:33.140 --> 07:34.140
You have helpers.

07:36.500 --> 07:37.010
Tell me.

07:37.580 --> 07:38.780
Who are your helpers?

07:38.900 --> 07:40.430
Why haven't you done it yet?

07:57.180 --> 07:59.909
There's only one Liu Shao in the Immortal Palace.

08:00.460 --> 08:01.390
What do you mean?

08:02.300 --> 08:04.900
I want you to replace Liu Shao once and for all.

08:10.620 --> 08:12.080
Why are you doing this now?

08:12.620 --> 08:13.680
What's your hurry?

08:16.380 --> 08:18.380
I need to seal up her features first.

08:19.450 --> 08:21.300
Otherwise, the Wang Bell in her hand

08:21.300 --> 08:23.060
would carry a message to Luo Ge.

08:26.810 --> 08:27.940
You know what?

08:28.460 --> 08:30.660
Luo Ge gave Liu Shao half of the talisman

08:30.740 --> 08:32.260
that made him immortal.

08:39.900 --> 08:41.630
This is Xie Lingqi's talisman.

08:42.659 --> 08:43.260
Tell me.

08:44.020 --> 08:45.540
Isn't it fun

08:46.380 --> 08:48.510
to use the stuff of the Immortal Palace

08:50.020 --> 08:51.550
to refine Luo Ge's beloved?

09:02.220 --> 09:03.570
I've taken care of it.

09:04.700 --> 09:06.300
Don't forget the Moon Sword.

09:29.460 --> 09:32.500
The only person Luo Ge can love is me.

09:33.260 --> 09:35.620
It must be hard

09:36.130 --> 09:37.730
not being able to see or hear.

09:38.010 --> 09:39.540
Luo Ge won't let you go.

10:33.900 --> 10:34.900
What do you think?

10:35.260 --> 10:36.300
Am I like you?

11:10.860 --> 11:11.540
Liu Shao!

11:25.340 --> 11:27.400
I robbed Bai Feng of her demon energy.

11:27.420 --> 11:28.580
It belongs to Ao Hen.

11:30.380 --> 11:32.510
I was finally cleared of my suspicion.

11:35.380 --> 11:35.940
Liu Shao.

11:54.780 --> 11:55.660
Luo Ge.

11:56.380 --> 11:57.780
I'm thirsty.

11:59.540 --> 12:00.890
I want some water.

12:01.260 --> 12:01.860
Okay.

12:19.140 --> 12:19.500
Here.

12:20.740 --> 12:21.420
It's hot.

12:28.940 --> 12:30.180
I'm so cold.

12:39.100 --> 12:41.380
How am I supposed to fool Luo Ge?

12:42.660 --> 12:44.300
If Luo Ge is still conscious,

12:44.700 --> 12:45.580
of course not.

12:46.580 --> 12:48.300
But didn't you say that?

12:49.010 --> 12:50.540
As long as you can get Luo Ge,

12:50.860 --> 12:52.420
you don't care what he looks like,

12:52.420 --> 12:54.820
even if he's just a walking corpse.

12:56.300 --> 12:58.250
You wanted me to find a way

12:59.060 --> 13:01.020
to put Luo Ge in a coma,

13:01.540 --> 13:03.380
unable to tell whether Liu Shao

13:03.540 --> 13:04.740
was real or not?

13:07.500 --> 13:08.060
Yes.

13:09.100 --> 13:11.700
Doesn't your master have a lot of crooked ways?

13:12.860 --> 13:14.920
Then you have to promise me one thing.

13:15.300 --> 13:15.830
Go ahead.

13:16.420 --> 13:18.020
I want to make Liu Shao's life

13:18.260 --> 13:19.940
a living hell.

13:26.260 --> 13:27.060
Why

13:27.650 --> 13:29.380
is the water bitter?

13:32.180 --> 13:33.020
Bitter?

13:45.820 --> 13:47.020
What's in the water?

13:49.820 --> 13:50.300
No.

13:50.980 --> 13:52.110
You're not Liu Shao.

13:52.780 --> 13:53.710
You're Bai Feng.

14:02.860 --> 14:05.780
The water contained fragments of the divine spirit in Liu Shao's body.

14:05.780 --> 14:08.420
I know your spiritual powers are against each other.

14:08.420 --> 14:09.940
It's the only way

14:09.940 --> 14:11.570
to control you.

14:19.900 --> 14:20.740
Lu Li.

14:21.780 --> 14:22.980
When you were young,

14:23.780 --> 14:25.060
I held you like this

14:26.690 --> 14:29.490
to accompany you through the pain again and again.

14:29.820 --> 14:31.740
Now I'm still your senior sister.

14:33.900 --> 14:35.300
And you're still Lu Li.

14:37.460 --> 14:39.460
When I take care of Liu Shao,

14:40.500 --> 14:42.540
we can be together forever.

15:15.010 --> 15:15.740
Bai Feng!

15:20.620 --> 15:21.680
What's this place?

15:23.850 --> 15:24.910
What's this place?

15:31.580 --> 15:32.250
Bai Feng!

15:36.860 --> 15:37.860
Answer me!

15:38.330 --> 15:40.260
Bai Feng! Let me out!

15:41.860 --> 15:42.620
Bai Feng!

15:50.580 --> 15:52.820
Bai Feng lied about being sent by the Immortal Master.

15:52.820 --> 15:54.700
She lay in wait beside the Immortal,

15:54.700 --> 15:56.980
but her spirit was sucked by the Xuan Ling Wood.

15:56.980 --> 15:59.100
As the Immortal had said,

15:59.570 --> 16:00.740
there was Ao Hen's demon energy

16:00.740 --> 16:02.060
in the dew.

16:02.220 --> 16:04.220
Bai Feng can't argue, so...

16:05.220 --> 16:06.020
So what?

16:07.100 --> 16:08.660
I don't know what Bai Feng did

16:08.660 --> 16:09.860
to hurt the Immortal.

16:09.900 --> 16:11.740
He is now recuperating at Palace Chonghua.

16:11.740 --> 16:13.400
And Bai Feng has disappeared.

16:16.900 --> 16:18.860
Please catch Bai Feng

16:18.890 --> 16:19.900
and clear my name.

16:22.660 --> 16:23.730
I'm sure I'll

16:23.730 --> 16:25.530
get to the bottom of this matter.

16:25.660 --> 16:27.420
If it is what you say it is,

16:27.900 --> 16:29.500
I will clear your name.

16:30.780 --> 16:32.100
As for the rest,

16:32.700 --> 16:35.260
we'll have to wait until Ge recovers.

16:40.460 --> 16:41.260
But

16:42.100 --> 16:43.890
I still say,

16:44.180 --> 16:46.210
even for Luo Ge's sake,

16:46.780 --> 16:48.040
there's no room for you

16:48.660 --> 16:50.140
in the Xiyin Mountain.

16:53.260 --> 16:53.860
Yes.

16:57.970 --> 16:58.660
Go.

17:20.740 --> 17:22.220
The Moon Sword is over there.

17:22.220 --> 17:22.980
Go get it.

17:23.780 --> 17:24.819
Where is Luo Ge?

17:25.819 --> 17:27.020
You want the Moon Sword.

17:27.020 --> 17:28.880
The rest is none of your business.

17:28.980 --> 17:29.820
Hurry up.

17:29.980 --> 17:31.440
Don't let anyone find out.

17:42.580 --> 17:43.710
Luo Ge was cautious.

17:44.580 --> 17:45.580
I was careless.

17:46.580 --> 17:47.780
Give me a little time.

17:48.220 --> 17:49.280
I'll figure it out.

18:14.420 --> 18:15.750
What are you doing here?

18:16.820 --> 18:17.700
Just now,

18:17.900 --> 18:19.690
the Immortal Master sent someone

18:19.690 --> 18:21.570
to secretly search for a spy.

18:22.140 --> 18:23.100
So,

18:25.460 --> 18:27.190
I've been waiting here for you.

18:28.530 --> 18:29.660
In fact, I know that

18:29.900 --> 18:32.560
you have not only broken this boundary long ago,

18:32.780 --> 18:33.660
but also

18:34.140 --> 18:35.900
you can leave Xiyin Mountain.

18:36.860 --> 18:38.390
And you went to see Bai Feng,

18:39.540 --> 18:40.060
right?

18:41.060 --> 18:42.590
You may have forgotten that

18:43.020 --> 18:44.480
I'm good at making incense

18:45.100 --> 18:47.700
and have a very sensitive sense of smell.

18:49.220 --> 18:50.660
I've long smelled

18:50.980 --> 18:52.020
something

18:52.620 --> 18:54.700
other than the Xiyin Mountain

18:54.700 --> 18:55.980
on you.

18:56.860 --> 18:58.390
And you smell like Bai Feng.

19:00.100 --> 19:01.620
Why didn't you turn me in?

19:01.900 --> 19:03.220
Because I want to know

19:03.540 --> 19:05.340
why on earth you went to Bai Feng.

19:06.180 --> 19:07.100
Besides,

19:07.300 --> 19:08.740
I want to know if you had anything to do

19:08.740 --> 19:10.180
with this spy thing.

19:11.420 --> 19:12.580
I did help her,

19:13.490 --> 19:15.340
because I need her to do me a favor.

19:15.340 --> 19:16.260
What is it?

19:16.460 --> 19:18.020
She has Ao Hen's demon energy.

19:18.020 --> 19:20.620
She can help the Demon King put down the rebellion in the demon world.

19:20.620 --> 19:22.700
I would give anything

19:23.570 --> 19:25.250
to help the Demon King.

19:27.300 --> 19:28.460
Anything?

19:31.770 --> 19:33.300
Do you feel that

19:34.100 --> 19:35.560
this person in front of you

19:35.940 --> 19:37.470
is no longer the same person

19:37.500 --> 19:39.100
who made you laugh and played with you before?

19:39.100 --> 19:39.980
Now,

19:41.300 --> 19:42.660
I'm the real Fu.

19:48.180 --> 19:49.700
At that time, the Demon King

19:49.700 --> 19:50.740
was very talented

19:51.540 --> 19:52.540
and energetic.

19:53.580 --> 19:54.740
But for me,

19:55.260 --> 19:57.790
he was trapped by responsibility step by step

19:57.940 --> 19:58.940
and became a poor man

19:58.940 --> 20:01.140
who couldn't even protect his brother.

20:03.900 --> 20:04.900
If I have to choose

20:05.100 --> 20:06.160
between integrity

20:06.300 --> 20:08.340
and my brother,

20:09.340 --> 20:10.820
I'd be willing to be

20:11.500 --> 20:12.760
the scariest monster.

20:16.580 --> 20:17.140
Luo Ning.

20:18.260 --> 20:19.140
I think

20:19.620 --> 20:20.820
I'm letting you down.

20:27.340 --> 20:28.860
I'm willing to pay for my sins with my life,

20:28.860 --> 20:32.320
as long as the Immortal give up his anger on the Aquatic Demons.

20:35.260 --> 20:36.580
I don't need your life.

20:37.860 --> 20:38.540
Fu.

20:39.660 --> 20:41.320
It's nice to meet the real you.

20:43.300 --> 20:44.180
Don't worry.

20:44.740 --> 20:45.940
I'm not gonna hurt you

20:46.820 --> 20:48.420
and I'm not gonna tell on you.

20:49.180 --> 20:49.780
Really?

20:52.180 --> 20:53.300
But remember.

20:53.860 --> 20:54.820
Stop saying

20:54.900 --> 20:56.700
you're willing to pay any price.

20:56.700 --> 20:58.700
And don't hurt any innocent people.

20:59.460 --> 21:01.220
Don't try to hurt my brother.

21:01.620 --> 21:02.380
Otherwise,

21:03.060 --> 21:04.320
I will never let you go.

21:07.100 --> 21:07.630
Luo Ning.

21:08.460 --> 21:09.740
I really appreciate

21:09.900 --> 21:11.900
meeting you in the Immortal Palace.

21:11.980 --> 21:13.580
You know what I did to my brother

21:13.580 --> 21:14.690
and my people.

21:15.180 --> 21:17.380
And you're willing to face the truth about me.

21:17.380 --> 21:18.580
If it weren't for you,

21:18.780 --> 21:19.780
I would be a monster

21:19.780 --> 21:21.540
I wouldn't even know myself.

21:24.940 --> 21:25.580
Well.

21:26.300 --> 21:27.420
Don't worry.

21:27.500 --> 21:29.210
As long as you don't do anything bad,

21:29.210 --> 21:30.780
I promise you'll be fine.

21:31.020 --> 21:31.780
Besides,

21:32.460 --> 21:33.580
I'm counting on you

21:33.780 --> 21:35.710
to recite a roomful of books for me.

21:36.300 --> 21:36.860
Right?

21:49.260 --> 21:50.100
Luo Ge.

21:50.980 --> 21:52.580
Do you know how long

21:53.220 --> 21:54.950
I've been waiting for this day?

21:55.300 --> 21:56.420
But that's okay.

21:57.180 --> 21:58.140
Soon

21:58.500 --> 22:00.740
you'll be with me forever.

22:02.060 --> 22:03.940
Bai Feng! Let me out!

22:26.900 --> 22:27.500
Luo Ge.

22:27.780 --> 22:28.500
Luo Ge!

22:30.060 --> 22:30.620
Bai Feng!

22:30.740 --> 22:32.070
What did you do to Luo Ge?

22:33.660 --> 22:34.540
Nothing.

22:35.340 --> 22:36.860
You asked me to let you out.

22:37.940 --> 22:39.200
Are you satisfied now?

22:39.820 --> 22:41.820
I gave him a good rest.

22:42.460 --> 22:43.460
Soon

22:43.740 --> 22:45.860
he'll be with me forever.

22:48.540 --> 22:50.090
Do you want to pretend to be me for the rest of your life?

22:50.090 --> 22:52.500
Aren't you afraid of being discovered by the people in the Immortal Palace?

22:52.500 --> 22:53.180
Bai Feng,

22:53.500 --> 22:54.930
I advise you to stop dreaming.

22:54.930 --> 22:56.220
A fake is always a fake.

22:56.220 --> 22:57.420
It can never be real.

23:18.300 --> 23:21.500
As long as you stay within this cauldron for seven days,

23:22.140 --> 23:24.260
you'll die.

23:24.660 --> 23:26.500
And you'll

23:26.780 --> 23:28.500
never exist again.

23:33.660 --> 23:34.410
Bai Feng.

23:34.620 --> 23:35.820
What did you do to him?

23:35.820 --> 23:37.150
What happened to Luo Ge?

23:37.780 --> 23:38.540
What?

23:39.420 --> 23:40.540
You feel bad?

23:41.340 --> 23:42.870
I have you to thank for that.

23:45.900 --> 23:47.450
The fragments of Sun Spirit

23:47.620 --> 23:49.380
have been with you forever.

23:49.660 --> 23:51.100
So it's really hard for me

23:51.300 --> 23:52.560
to get a little bit out.

23:53.100 --> 23:54.500
But thanks to it,

23:55.020 --> 23:57.780
Luo Ge was so obedient.

23:59.900 --> 24:00.660
Luo Ge!

24:01.140 --> 24:02.400
I'll have tea with you.

24:04.540 --> 24:05.700
Excuse me.

24:06.340 --> 24:08.620
Just enjoy yourself.

24:09.420 --> 24:11.420
She used the Sun Fragments on Luo Ge

24:11.420 --> 24:12.350
because of me...

24:13.060 --> 24:13.820
No.

24:13.820 --> 24:14.820
I have to save him.

24:23.220 --> 24:24.020
Master Shang.

24:24.210 --> 24:25.340
The Immortal needs a rest.

24:25.340 --> 24:26.870
No visitors for the moment.

24:28.410 --> 24:29.670
Does he not even see me?

24:30.340 --> 24:30.930
What?

24:31.460 --> 24:34.380
You don't want him to be quiet?

24:36.900 --> 24:38.180
Then let him rest.

24:46.420 --> 24:47.260
Liu Shao.

24:47.980 --> 24:50.440
Why do I feel like you're acting weird today?

24:51.980 --> 24:53.300
It's just chilling to think about

24:53.300 --> 24:55.020
what's going on

24:55.500 --> 24:56.700
in the Litian Temple.

25:17.420 --> 25:18.100
Wang Bell.

25:18.100 --> 25:19.420
You have Luo Ge's immortal power.

25:19.420 --> 25:21.150
Get to him and help him recover.

25:24.780 --> 25:25.860
Why do you resist?

25:25.860 --> 25:27.250
Luo Ge told you to stay with me.

25:27.250 --> 25:28.050
You saving him

25:28.260 --> 25:29.720
is just like you saving me.

25:30.460 --> 25:31.860
You have to go back for me.

25:31.860 --> 25:32.780
You have to

25:33.420 --> 25:34.480
protect him for me.

25:50.980 --> 25:52.020
Ice Spirit.

25:52.450 --> 25:53.850
The heart is like the ice,

25:53.860 --> 25:54.590
no dirt on it.

25:55.170 --> 25:56.580
Being and nought can turn to each other.

25:56.580 --> 25:58.710
It can relieve the mind and the spirit.

26:02.060 --> 26:02.970
At this point,

26:03.460 --> 26:05.120
there's nothing else I can do.

26:05.140 --> 26:06.400
Even if I can't get out,

26:06.700 --> 26:07.780
I'm gonna keep him.

26:10.930 --> 26:11.340
Luo Ge!

26:12.380 --> 26:13.440
You need to wake up!

26:13.700 --> 26:14.420
Luo Ge!

26:19.940 --> 26:20.700
Liu Shao.

26:32.980 --> 26:34.710
How did the Wang Bell come back?

26:38.540 --> 26:40.070
I can't believe you woke up.

26:40.460 --> 26:41.460
Where is Liu Shao?

26:46.700 --> 26:48.980
So you took back the Moon Bell.

26:50.180 --> 26:51.140
I thought

26:51.140 --> 26:53.060
you had strong feelings for her.

26:53.900 --> 26:56.940
But you still flew apart when the disaster struck.

27:00.460 --> 27:01.300
Liu Shao.

27:01.570 --> 27:02.580
Do you see?

27:03.020 --> 27:05.140
When you were burned to ashes,

27:05.140 --> 27:07.260
he took it back just the same.

27:07.740 --> 27:08.540
Now

27:08.820 --> 27:10.340
you can die in peace.

27:10.500 --> 27:11.630
Liu Shao is in there.

27:30.540 --> 27:31.340
Luo Ge.

27:33.090 --> 27:35.220
I'd love to be by your side all the time.

27:36.380 --> 27:37.460
Mom and Dad.

27:38.540 --> 27:40.500
I want to go back and see you.

27:54.380 --> 27:55.140
He Na.

27:56.140 --> 27:57.100
I really

27:57.380 --> 27:58.900
want to see the day

27:59.980 --> 28:01.820
you become the Demon King.

28:02.740 --> 28:03.670
Unfortunately,

28:04.900 --> 28:05.960
there's no chance.

28:26.380 --> 28:28.500
You're saying the Eagle Demon in the Hundred Demons Mausoleum has changed?

28:28.500 --> 28:29.060
Yes.

28:29.780 --> 28:31.910
Your Majesty has devoured the demons.

28:32.020 --> 28:34.140
Now all demons know it.

28:34.220 --> 28:36.020
The Eagle Demon is fierce and ferocious.

28:36.020 --> 28:37.660
It will not be reconciled to submission.

28:37.660 --> 28:40.020
I'm afraid it's not good.

28:40.330 --> 28:42.540
Your Majesty needs to plan ahead.

28:42.820 --> 28:43.740
He Na.

28:44.630 --> 28:45.820
I really

28:46.300 --> 28:47.940
want to see the day

28:48.140 --> 28:49.860
you become the Demon King.

28:49.900 --> 28:50.580
Liu Shao.

28:50.810 --> 28:51.740
Unfortunately,

28:52.700 --> 28:54.060
there's no chance.

28:55.060 --> 28:55.660
Mr. Tai.

28:55.820 --> 28:57.100
I have to leave for an emergency.

28:57.100 --> 29:00.830
You must be careful to guard against the Hundred Demons Mausoleum.

29:01.260 --> 29:02.860
The enemy is present,

29:03.860 --> 29:05.020
but His Majesty...

29:13.220 --> 29:13.780
Liu Shao.

29:23.420 --> 29:24.060
Liu Shao.

29:24.940 --> 29:25.500
What happened?

29:25.500 --> 29:25.980
He Na.

29:26.900 --> 29:28.100
What are you doing here?

29:28.100 --> 29:29.050
If you are in danger,

29:29.050 --> 29:30.660
the Phoenix Eye Lotus will summon me.

29:30.660 --> 29:31.500
Are you okay?

29:35.500 --> 29:36.560
What is this place?

29:37.500 --> 29:38.500
This is a cauldron

29:39.260 --> 29:40.300
Bai Feng found somewhere

29:40.300 --> 29:41.980
to refine the living.

29:43.260 --> 29:44.900
I was caught by Bai Feng.

29:45.700 --> 29:48.060
This place has no exit.

29:50.980 --> 29:52.640
Looks like we need to find a way

29:52.980 --> 29:54.840
to break this cauldron and leave.

29:55.500 --> 29:57.060
I've tried everything,

29:57.340 --> 29:59.600
but I couldn't break this cauldron open.

30:00.570 --> 30:01.500
He Na.

30:02.820 --> 30:04.540
You're not supposed to be here.

30:04.540 --> 30:05.800
You're Aquatic Demon.

30:06.780 --> 30:08.710
This demon fire is very bad for you.

30:08.780 --> 30:10.100
You won't last long.

30:11.780 --> 30:12.980
I have to give it a try.

30:38.260 --> 30:39.220
The Moon Bell

30:41.060 --> 30:42.810
should belong to you and me.

30:46.100 --> 30:47.940
Liu Shao doesn't deserve it.

30:49.380 --> 30:53.180
The Eagle Demon of the Hundred Demons Mausoleum has a talisman to break the boundary.

30:53.180 --> 30:54.780
Now that the Demon King is not here,

30:54.780 --> 30:56.540
you must be careful.

31:05.900 --> 31:06.960
Hold on, everyone!

31:08.750 --> 31:11.100
[The Eagle Demon of the Hundred Demons Mausoleum]

31:19.180 --> 31:19.980
Your Majesty!

31:20.060 --> 31:21.380
The Eagle Demon has invaded.

31:21.380 --> 31:22.730
Please return as soon as possible.

31:22.730 --> 31:24.300
We can't hold on anymore.

31:30.090 --> 31:32.490
Something happened to the Aquatic Demons.

31:39.060 --> 31:40.570
The demon fire has entered the bottom of the furnace.

31:40.570 --> 31:41.300
Do you think

31:41.460 --> 31:43.020
she stands a chance?

31:44.370 --> 31:45.370
Accept your fate.

31:45.740 --> 31:47.860
Liu Shao would be dead by now.

31:48.060 --> 31:50.140
I'm the one for you.

31:51.860 --> 31:53.300
He Na, you'd better go.

31:53.780 --> 31:54.840
I'm fine, Liu Shao.

31:55.540 --> 31:56.380
You know,

31:57.610 --> 31:58.660
I'm your demon.

31:59.260 --> 32:00.380
I'll protect you.

32:01.020 --> 32:02.220
I'll be there for you.

32:04.140 --> 32:04.780
Shut up.

32:06.410 --> 32:08.870
I don't want to hear your nonsense right now.

32:12.740 --> 32:14.540
You're not that weak at all.

32:15.020 --> 32:18.140
Since the cauldron can't be broken with external force,

32:18.140 --> 32:20.740
what if I use the caster's own spiritual power?

32:42.980 --> 32:43.740
He Na.

32:44.500 --> 32:45.090
Look.

32:45.930 --> 32:46.990
It's the Moon Bell.

32:53.780 --> 32:55.020
Looks like Luo Ge

32:55.700 --> 32:57.830
is also exerting force on the outside.

32:58.020 --> 32:59.020
I'll give it a try.

33:23.700 --> 33:24.020
Liu Shao.

33:24.020 --> 33:24.740
Luo Ge.

33:24.940 --> 33:26.380
I knew you would come by.

33:37.660 --> 33:39.990
I knew there was something wrong with you.

33:46.100 --> 33:46.860
I'll go after her.

33:46.860 --> 33:47.460
Liu Shao.

33:50.210 --> 33:51.050
You're not healed yet.

33:51.050 --> 33:52.060
I'll keep an eye on her.

33:52.060 --> 33:52.790
Don't worry.

33:58.100 --> 33:59.960
I wasn't in the name of Demon King,

34:00.090 --> 34:01.550
but as a friend of Liu Shao.

34:02.060 --> 34:04.720
Please lift the ban of the Immortal Palace on me.

34:04.740 --> 34:06.800
At least when she's in trouble again,

34:06.860 --> 34:09.520
she'll be able to summon me like she always does.

34:09.860 --> 34:11.190
No matter how hard it is,

34:12.260 --> 34:13.380
I will be there.

34:14.340 --> 34:14.980
Thank you.

34:15.540 --> 34:16.739
You don't have to thank me.

34:16.739 --> 34:18.100
There's no need to say thank you

34:18.100 --> 34:19.429
between me and Liu Shao.

34:20.300 --> 34:21.900
I have something important to do.

34:21.900 --> 34:22.460
Goodbye.

34:23.300 --> 34:23.820
Wait.

34:38.020 --> 34:38.659
Thank you.

34:42.219 --> 34:44.820
Bai Feng couldn't have done it by herself.

34:46.020 --> 34:48.699
I need to heal wounds caused by the Sun's spiritual power

34:48.699 --> 34:52.500
and find out who's messing with the Three Realms as soon as possible.

35:31.740 --> 35:32.300
Mr. Tai.

35:32.540 --> 35:33.270
Are you okay?

35:34.140 --> 35:35.100
I'm fine.

35:40.100 --> 35:40.900
Your Majesty!

36:33.260 --> 36:34.900
I subdued the demons

36:35.130 --> 36:36.990
for the peace of the Three Realms.

36:37.100 --> 36:38.960
You don't have to surrender to me.

36:38.980 --> 36:41.110
But you ignored the rules of the Demons

36:41.340 --> 36:42.900
and made a special attack.

36:43.860 --> 36:45.700
I'll bring you to justice today.

36:46.420 --> 36:48.750
I know I can't do anything to you right now.

36:49.820 --> 36:50.620
But

36:50.980 --> 36:52.940
do you know

36:53.340 --> 36:54.780
who you're up against?

37:07.690 --> 37:08.490
Your Majesty!

37:27.580 --> 37:28.820
Three

37:29.130 --> 37:30.140
of the Four Demons

37:30.260 --> 37:31.620
have surrendered to me.

37:32.460 --> 37:34.060
I am the king in the water.

37:34.660 --> 37:35.140
On land,

37:35.540 --> 37:37.100
I am also the king.

37:37.420 --> 37:38.900
Your leader is dead.

37:39.500 --> 37:41.160
Do you still dare not surrend?

37:41.500 --> 37:43.340
Your Majesty!

37:43.850 --> 37:45.820
Your Majesty!

38:03.740 --> 38:04.500
Bai Feng.

38:07.420 --> 38:08.380
You owe me

38:08.620 --> 38:09.500
one more favor.

38:09.940 --> 38:10.740
I owe you?

38:11.900 --> 38:12.830
What do I owe you?

38:13.020 --> 38:14.020
Lu Li owes me.

38:14.020 --> 38:15.340
Luo Ge owes me.

38:15.570 --> 38:16.740
People like you

38:16.980 --> 38:18.910
seem like the whole world owes you.

38:19.020 --> 38:20.140
Bai Feng pretended to be me.

38:20.140 --> 38:21.580
She assassinated the Immortal Master,

38:21.580 --> 38:22.420
imprisoned me

38:22.660 --> 38:24.020
and murdered the Immortal Luo Ge.

38:24.020 --> 38:25.450
If it weren't for my friend's help,

38:25.450 --> 38:26.780
I would have been ashes.

38:28.060 --> 38:30.580
Murder against the Immortal is unforgivable.

38:30.580 --> 38:31.330
Murder?

38:32.170 --> 38:32.940
Who are you

38:33.700 --> 38:35.340
to say I murdered him?

38:35.900 --> 38:36.780
At least

38:37.100 --> 38:40.100
I won't let him endure the pain of psychic resistance.

38:40.370 --> 38:43.030
And I won't let him take the brunt of the thunder.

38:43.260 --> 38:44.130
All I want

38:44.900 --> 38:46.180
is for him to love me.

38:46.420 --> 38:47.620
What right?

38:47.930 --> 38:48.740
What responsibility?

38:48.740 --> 38:49.660
What Three Realms?

38:49.660 --> 38:50.780
Go to hell!

38:51.260 --> 38:52.790
Whether it's Lu Li or Luo Ge,

38:52.970 --> 38:54.820
they should belong to me alone.

38:55.460 --> 38:57.700
You're so vicious and shameless.

38:58.660 --> 38:59.920
I'm really impressed.

39:32.220 --> 39:34.660
Your Majesty is different from us.

39:35.060 --> 39:36.860
You weren't afraid of Li water.

39:37.300 --> 39:39.260
but you're burned like this.

39:41.780 --> 39:42.980
May I ask...

39:43.500 --> 39:45.220
Is it about Miss Liu Shao?

39:48.580 --> 39:49.140
Your Majesty.

39:49.140 --> 39:51.780
Miss Liu Shao doesn't care about you.

39:52.580 --> 39:55.020
Why would you do that to her?

39:55.860 --> 39:57.120
It's just a skin wound.

39:58.020 --> 40:00.150
It's nothing compared to the fact that

40:00.820 --> 40:01.750
I saved her life.

40:19.260 --> 40:21.660
I had no idea the Eagle Demon was so vicious.

40:22.140 --> 40:23.780
He would give his life

40:24.620 --> 40:25.780
and blood

40:26.420 --> 40:28.130
to get rid of your right arm.

40:31.660 --> 40:32.660
Can it be treated?

40:35.500 --> 40:37.140
All I could do was stop the gas

40:37.460 --> 40:39.300
and save your arm.

40:40.900 --> 40:42.340
But your right hand

40:42.740 --> 40:44.100
will be broken.

40:45.180 --> 40:46.660
From now on, this right arm

40:47.050 --> 40:49.060
will no longer be able to induce the spiritual power

40:49.060 --> 40:50.060
and can't fight.

40:51.660 --> 40:54.120
I'm afraid you can't even lift heavy things.

40:55.820 --> 40:56.540
Do it.

40:58.900 --> 40:59.740
Do it.

41:00.780 --> 41:01.970
What are you waiting for?

41:01.970 --> 41:03.570
A thousand years of practice

41:03.900 --> 41:05.980
was destroyed by this woman.

41:07.100 --> 41:09.020
Is it worth it?
